/**
 * Umair TikTok Wala PayPal Service
 * Sheet <-> Firestore — push, auto-fill aur settings sync (v6)
 *
 * Ye file purani Code.gs ke SAATH kaam karti hai — usay badalna nahi.
 *
 * SETUP (ek dafa):
 *   1) Ye poora code PushToFirestore file mein paste karein (purana sab hata dein)
 *   2) Upar dropdown se "installSyncV4" chunein aur Run dabayein
 *   3) Naya menu "UTW Finance" aa jayega
 *
 *
 * v6 MEIN KYA BADLA
 * =================
 *   - Admin dashboard ke "New entries" se aayi lines ab Payment Entries
 *     sheet mein khud aa jati hain (entryQueue -> sheet).
 *   - Baqi sab bilkul waisa hi hai. Hisab abhi bhi sheet ke formulas
 *     karte hain, aur claim matcher abhi bhi sheet hi parhta hai.
 *
 * v5 MEIN KYA BADLA THA
 * =====================
 *   - Settings sheet ab Firestore mein jati hai (financeSettings/main)
 *   - "Build settlements" ab yahan se NAHI hota — dashboard karta hai
 *     (dono jagah se chalega to duplicate settlements ban jayenge)
 *
 *
 * TABS KA NIZAAM
 * ==============
 *
 *   Payment Entries   sheet -> Firebase   (formulas hain, is liye poori row
 *                                          kabhi Firebase se wapas nahi aati.
 *                                          Nayi lines entryQueue se aati hain.)
 *   Payment Methods   Firebase -> sheet   + Status/Verified By/Notes wapas
 *   Settlements       dashboard banata hai, Firebase se sheet mein aate hain
 *   Assignments       sheet -> Firebase
 *   PayPal Accounts   sheet -> Firebase
 *   Notifications     sheet -> Firebase
 *   Settings          sheet -> Firebase
 *   Finance Students  purane Code.gs se, waise ka waisa
 *
 *
 * PAYMENT ENTRIES — kaam ka tareeqa
 * =================================
 *
 *   Ab do raste hain, dono barabar chalte hain:
 *
 *   (a) DASHBOARD SE — finance-admin.html ka "New entries"
 *       Email, number aur raqam likhein. Line entryQueue mein jati hai,
 *       aur har 5 minute drainEntryQueue_ usay sheet ki neeche wali
 *       khali row mein daal deta hai. Formulas upar wali row se copy
 *       hote hain, to hisab bilkul waise hi banta hai jaise pehle.
 *
 *   (b) SHEET SE — pehle ki tarah haath se
 *       PayPal Email ek dafa likhein, neeche khali chhor dein:
 *
 *         E: umairpaypal@gmail.com    J: 500
 *         E: (khali)                  J: 300
 *         E: (khali)                  J: 499
 *
 *       Khali ka matlab "upar wali hi email".
 *
 *   Student UID (F):
 *     - Pata ho to phone number likh dein -> UID khud ban jayega
 *     - Pata na ho to khali chhor dein -> wo raqam pool mein rahegi,
 *       jahan se student claim karega
 *
 *   Status (S) — sheet ka apna dropdown:
 *     Pending / On Hold / Declined  -> settlement mein NAHI jayega
 *     Verified / Paid               -> settlement mein ginti hoga
 */

